# `TIMING-GENRE-NAMING`: the EXPERIMENTAL genre `wave` became `timing`, as the
# header genre token AND as the block opener. `wave` was WaveDrom's MEMBER
# KEY — in WaveJSON `signal` is the root object and `wave` is a property of
# one signal, its lane activity string — so FigDown named a figure kind after
# a per-lane attribute and left WaveDrom's own figure name ("Digital Timing
# Diagram") unused. Both positions carry the named diagnostic.
figdown 0.1 wave
wave w "W"
signal clk pppp
